    "prompt": "What is the value of $\\left(1+\\frac15\\right)\\times\\left(1+\\frac16\\right)\\times\\left(1+\\frac17\\right)\\times\\left(1+\\frac18\\right)\\times\\left(1+\\frac19\\right)$?",
    "layout": "list",
